
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CUSTOMER.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 CUSTOMER-ID    PIC X(12).
01 CUSTOMER-NAME  PIC X(40).
01 ACCOUNT-TYPE   PIC X(20).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ACCEPT CUSTOMER-ID
    ACCEPT CUSTOMER-NAME
    ACCEPT ACCOUNT-TYPE

    DISPLAY "Customer ID: " FUNCTION TRIM(CUSTOMER-ID)
    DISPLAY "Name: " FUNCTION TRIM(CUSTOMER-NAME)
    DISPLAY "Account Type: " FUNCTION TRIM(ACCOUNT-TYPE)

    STOP RUN.
